# Corrected subjects for CHANGELOG.md, read by `cargo xtask changelog`.
# A pushed commit cannot be reworded without rewriting every hash after it,
# so a wrong subject is corrected here: `<full hash> <subject>`, one a line.

# The release gate's decision moved from D516 to D521 before #63 merged.
